SDUSD::maxDeposit
├── given PAUSE_TYPE or FROZEN_TYPE is active
│   └── it should return zero for every receiver
├── given neither PAUSE_TYPE nor FROZEN_TYPE is active and total supply is zero
│   ├── when receiver is address(1)
│   │   └── it should return seedShares independently of depositCap
│   └── when receiver is not address(1)
│       └── it should return zero
└── given neither PAUSE_TYPE nor FROZEN_TYPE is active and total supply is non-zero
    ├── when depositCapUsage is below depositCap
    │   ├── when the remaining DUSD headroom converts to at least one share
    │   │   ├── it should return depositCap minus depositCapUsage
    │   │   ├── it should not vary by receiver
    │   │   └── released rewards should reduce headroom while locked rewards, raw donations, and share transfers do not
    │   └── when the remaining DUSD headroom rounds down to zero shares
    │       └── it should return zero
    └── when depositCapUsage is equal to or above depositCap
        └── it should return zero without underflowing
